[{"answer":"OK, Jim.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/1.mp3"},{"answer":"You wanted to see me about your textile design project.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/2.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been looking at how a range of natural dyes can be used to colour fabrics like cotton and wool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Why did you choose that topic?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I got a lot of useful ideas from the museum,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/6.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, at that exhibition of textiles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/7.mp3"},{"answer":"But I've always been interested in anything to do with colour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Years ago, I went to a carpet shop with my parents when we were on holiday in Turkey,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and I remember all the amazing colours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/10.mp3"},{"answer":"They might not all have been natural dyes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe not, but for the project I decided to follow it up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And I found a great book about a botanic garden in California that specialises in plants used for dyes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/13.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/14.mp3"},{"answer":"So, in your project, you had to include a practical investigation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/16.mp3"},{"answer":"At first I couldn't decide on my variables.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I was going to just look at one type of fibre for example, like cotton...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/18.mp3"},{"answer":"and see how different types of dyes affected it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I decided to include others as well,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/21.mp3"},{"answer":"so I looked at cotton and wool and nylon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/22.mp3"},{"answer":"With just one type of dye?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Various types, including some that weren't natural, for comparison.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/24.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/25.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I did the experiments last week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I used some ready-made natural dyes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I found a website which supplied them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/28.mp3"},{"answer":"they came in just a few days, but I also made some of my own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/29.mp3"},{"answer":"That must have taken quite a bit of time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought it'd just be a matter of a teaspoon or so of dye,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and actually that wasn't the case at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Like I was using one vegetable, beetroot, for a red dye,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and I had to chop up a whole pile of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/35.mp3"},{"answer":"So it all took longer than I'd expected.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/36.mp3"},{"answer":"One possibility is to use food colourings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I did use one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That was a yellow dye, an artificial one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Tartrazine?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. I used it on cotton first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/41.mp3"},{"answer":"It came out a great colour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/42.mp3"},{"answer":"but when I rinsed the material, the colour just washed away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd been going to try it out on nylon, but I abandoned that idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Were you worried about health issues?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd thought if it's a legal food colouring, it must be safe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it can occasionally cause allergic reactions, I believe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/47.mp3"},{"answer":"So what natural dyes did you look at?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, one was turmeric.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/49.mp3"},{"answer":"The colour's great, it's a really strong yellow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's generally used in dishes like curry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/51.mp3"},{"answer":"It's meant to be quite good for your health when eaten,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/52.mp3"},{"answer":"but you might find it's not permanent when it's used as a dye -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/53.mp3"},{"answer":"a few washes, and it's gone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I used beetroot as a dye for wool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/56.mp3"},{"answer":"When I chop up beetroot to eat I always end up with bright red hands,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/57.mp3"},{"answer":"but the wool ended up just a sort of watery cream shade. Disappointing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/58.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a natural dye called Tyrian purple. Have you heard of that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. It comes from a shellfish,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and it was worn in ancient times but only by important people as it was so rare.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't use it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/62.mp3"},{"answer":"It fell out of use centuries ago,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/63.mp3"},{"answer":"though one researcher managed to get hold of some recently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/64.mp3"},{"answer":"But that shade of purple can be produced by chemical dyes nowadays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you use any black dyes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Logwood.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/67.mp3"},{"answer":"That was quite complicated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I had to prepare the fabric so the dye would take.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope you were careful to wear gloves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I know the danger with that dye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Good. It can be extremely dangerous if it's ingested.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, presumably you had a look at an insect-based dye? Like cochineal, for example?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I didn't actually make that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't have time to start crushing up insects to get the red colour","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/75.mp3"},{"answer":"and anyway they're not available here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/76.mp3"},{"answer":"but I managed to get the dye quite easily from a website.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/77.mp3"},{"answer":"But it cost a fortune.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see why it's generally just used in cooking, and in small quantities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's very effective, but that's precisely why it's not used as a dye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/80.mp3"},{"answer":"I also read about using metal oxide.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Apparently you can allow iron to rust while it's in contact with the fabric, and that colours it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that works well for dying cotton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/83.mp3"},{"answer":"But you have to be careful as the metal can actually affect the fabric","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/84.mp3"},{"answer":"and so you can't expect to get a lot of wear out of fabrics treated in this way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/85.mp3"},{"answer":"And the colours are quite subtle, not everyone likes them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, it looks as if you've done a lot of work...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-3-2023-03-20-11-14-50/87.mp3"}]
